---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import '../styles/catalog-tools.css';
---

<Base
  title="Labels & Accessories: Match 4×6 Stock, Fanfold & Brother DK"
  description="A sourced media reference for Rollo, MUNBYN, Phomemo and Brother QL printers. Check exact dimensions and DK formats without universal-fit accessory claims."
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="page-heading">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <span>Labels &amp; accessories</span>
      </nav>
      <h1>
        The right stock.
        <br />
        <em>Fewer surprises.</em>
      </h1>
      <p>
        Start with the exact printer, not a universal-compatible badge. These are documented media
        families, not independently tested accessories or live offers. Reviewed November 5, 2026.
      </p>
    </header>
    <div class="media-table" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Media compatibility reference">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Printer / media family</th>
            <th>What is documented</th>
            <th>What to verify</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <th>Rollo X1038 / X1040</th>
            <td>Generic direct-thermal roll or fanfold stock, including 4 × 6 shipping formats.</td>
            <td>
              Media width, sensing, feed direction and external stock space.{' '}
              <a
                href="https://rollo-main.b-cdn.net/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/Rollo-USB-User-Guide.pdf"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
              >
                Rollo media guide
              </a>
              .
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th>MUNBYN ITPP941 USB / ITPP941B</th>
            <td>External direct-thermal stock. Model-specific width and detection requirements.</td>
            <td>
              Match the exact 203 dpi variant, liner and supported dimensions.{' '}
              <a
                href="https://pos.munbyn.com/munbyn-itpp941-series-thermal-label-printer/"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
              >
                Model parameter table
              </a>
              .
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th>Brother QL-1100 / QL-1110NWB</th>
            <td>
              Compatible DK die-cut and continuous rolls. US DK-1247: 4.07 × 6.4 in; DK-2205
              continuous: 2.4 in wide.
            </td>
            <td>
              These are different formats, not interchangeable 4 × 6 blanks. Confirm the DK part,
              holder and driver paper setting.{' '}
              <a
                href="https://assets.brother.com/asset/99182938-c310-4b42-b03f-7b9498f1d643/12442_BRO8665-1-QL1100QL1110nwbBrochure-Collection-052418-V3-pdf.pdf"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
              >
                Brother DK supplies brochure
              </a>
              .
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th>Phomemo PM241-BT</th>
            <td>4 × 6 shipping stock. The official page warns against HUOJI labels.</td>
            <td>
              Other widths remain a source discrepancy. Check the current manual before bulk
              ordering.{' '}
              <a
                href="https://phomemo.com/products/pm-241bt"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
              >
                Phomemo media notes
              </a>
              .
            </td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <section class="section">
      <h2>What about roll holders?</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">
        We have not verified a universal holder or an exact Amazon accessory variant. Match
        clearance, roll diameter and feed requirements before buying. No accessory purchase button
        is published without an exact identity check.
      </p>
      <div class="workbench-links">
        <a class="text-link" href="/guides/choose-compatible-thermal-labels/">
          Read the media buying guide
        </a>
        <a class="text-link" href="/tools/label-preview/">
          Understand label dimensions
        </a>
        <a class="text-link" href="/cost-calculator/">
          Compare your stock costs
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
